NPCs: {
	GuthixianDruid: {
		DisplayName: Guthixian Druid

		TownNPCMood: {
			Content: This is a nice town, it reminds me of Taverly.
			NoHome: Even a druid needs shelter.
			FarFromHome: I'm too far from home, could you spare some law runes?
			LoveSpace: I'm happy there's enough space to enjoy nature.
			DislikeCrowded: It's a bit too crowded around here.
			HateCrowded: It's far too crowded, I can't even enjoy nature.
			LikeBiome: I like {BiomeName}, there's plenty of herbs to gather!
			DislikeBiome: I dislike {BiomeName}, it's too hot and there's hardly any plants.
			LoveNPC: "{NPCName} strives for balance, she's a true follower of Guthix!"
			LikeNPC: I like {NPCName}, he makes some interesting potions.
			DislikeNPC: "{NPCName} is too noisy, she should learn to appreciate nature."
			HateNPC: That red cape... I fear {NPCName} may be a worshipper of Zamorak!
			LikeNPC_Princess: I like {NPCName}.
			Princess_LovesNPC: I like {NPCName}.
		}

		Dialogue: {
			Standard1: All in all, this world isn't too different from Gielinor.
			Standard2: I follow the teachings of Guthix, the God of balance.
			Standard3: Would you like some herblore training? I've got plenty of seeds and materials to spare.
			Standard4: Your herblore level is low, you should get back to training.
			Rare1: Guttthhhiixxxx!... Sorry, I don't know what came over me.
		}
	}
}

Bestiary.GuthixianDruid: This druid worships Guthix, the God of balance. He's an expert in herblore, the druidic art of mixing potions.
Emotes.GuthixianDruidEmote.Command: guthixiandruid

